From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:15:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gateway): bind routing owner before reference expansion
 [daveey]

Pre-turn context-length lookup precedes TurnRunner routing_session. Carry the authorized local chat identity into policy resolution while preserving an ambient owner and restoring scope on errors. No-session quota deferral is an error and gateway tests reject it.

Proof: regression fails on 7b52fcc7030 with quota refusal and missing payload; fixed routing/reference/session-policy suites pass 61 tests. All 21 importer suites exercised; four minimal-source fakes retained via optional chat_id lookup. Ambient-owner, missing-binding and severity mutants fail; injected no-session guard fails teardown. Live wall/payload verification remains with VERIFY after normal deployment.
